@startuml
' Clinical versus genetic diagnosis — structural comparison, English rendering.
' German twin: diagnose-klinisch-vs-genetisch-de.puml (renders to …-de.svg).
' See the header of diagnose-parallelmodell.puml for why the pair exists.
'
' Every line below was checked against the generated StructureDefinitions on
' 2026-09-03. NO 'left to right direction': it inverts arrow-direction
' semantics, turning '-[hidden]right->' into a vertical stack and costing the
' comparison its side-by-side arrangement.
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam class {
  BorderColor #4a86e8
  BackgroundColor #ffffff
  HeaderBackgroundColor #eef4fd
  FontColor #1a1a1a
}

title What sets the two profiles apart

class "MII_PR_Seltene_ClinicalDiagnosis" as C {
  code.coding[icd10-gm]   << inherited >>
  code.coding[orphanet]   << inherited >>
  code.coding[**hpo**]  0..*   << own slice >>
  <size:11>required → hpo-phenotypic-observation-codes</size>
  --
  category  1..*   <size:11>value not fixed</size>
  --
  evidence  0..*
  evidence.code.coding   <size:11>extensible → HPO</size>
  evidence.detail → Observation
}

class "MII_PR_Seltene_GeneticDiagnosis" as G {
  code.coding[icd10-gm]   << inherited >>
  code.coding[orphanet]   << inherited >>
  code.coding[**omim**]  0..*   << own slice >>
  --
  category  1..*   <size:11>**fixed value**</size>
  <size:11>= SCT#782964007 Genetic disease</size>
  --
  evidence  **1..***   <size:11>mandatory</size>
  evidence.code.coding[**geneticEvidence**]
  <size:11>= SCT#106221001 Genetic finding</size>
  evidence.detail  1..* → Observation | DiagnosticReport
  --
  extension[**penetrance**]
}

C -[hidden]right-> G

note bottom of C
  Evidenced by **phenotype** (HPO).
  Evidence is optional.
end note

note bottom of G
  Evidenced by **molecular genetics**.
  Evidence is **mandatory** (evidence 1..*),
  the MolGen variant is recommended.
end note

note as N
  **Identical in both:** verificationStatus is inherited
  unchanged as 0..1 (required, condition-ver-status);
  the module does not constrain it. The same holds for
  the assertion date (assertedDate) from the parent.
end note

@enduml
